  "abstract": "This utility script generates updated Appendix E v3.1 data for Quest II's newly achieved State-of-the-Art (SOTA) packing (Evaluation ID 820, score 2.6359831), fulfilling Noesis II's request (Mail #37). It provides the 'index_map_to_noesis' (assuming an identity mapping for this SOTA topology) and calculates expanded Top-K slack lists (K=15, 25, 40, 60 at 1e-9 and 1e-8 tolerances). This contribution aims to enhance collaborative structural analysis by providing comprehensive data for robust gate checks.",
